# What a prompt was opened on and another program deletes before Enter is not made again (track
# E3): a new note and a new folder in a folder gone by then are refused naming the folder, and
# a tag on a note gone by then names the note. A tag on two marked notes, one gone by then,
# counts it in the title and tags the other. tests/drive.rs plays the other program: when the
# script writes Inbox/zz-gone.md, it deletes the path written in it, and the file.
size 120x40
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
keys p johnston
wait-for David A. Johnston
keys enter
wait-for People/David A. Johnston  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys n
wait-for new note in People/
type Field notes
write Inbox/zz-gone.md People
wait-for example-workspace 32 notes
keys enter
wait-for can't create People/Field notes.md: People/ is no longer there
keys p krakat
wait-for Krakatoa
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Krakatoa  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys N
wait-for new folder in Volcanoes/
type Ash
write Inbox/zz-gone.md Volcanoes
wait-for example-workspace 23 notes
keys enter
wait-for can't create Volcanoes/Ash/: Volcanoes/ is no longer there
keys p lava
wait-for Lava
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Lava  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys #
wait-for tag Lava · -tag removes
type seismic
write Inbox/zz-gone.md Concepts/Lava.md
wait-for example-workspace 22 notes
keys enter
wait-for can't tag: Concepts/Lava.md is no longer there
keys p hotspot
wait-for Hotspot
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Hotspot  reading
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys space
wait-for 1 marked
keys space
wait-for 2 marked
keys #
wait-for tag 2 marked notes · -tag removes
type seismic
write Inbox/zz-gone.md Concepts/Hotspot.md
wait-for example-workspace 21 notes
wait-for tag 2 marked notes (1 gone) · -tag removes
keys enter
wait-for tagged 1 note #seismic · left alone: Concepts/Hotspot.md is no longer there
keys q
exits 0
